<title>USA: United Intl Q2 profit includes gain.</title>
<headline>United Intl Q2 profit includes gain.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Aug 31.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.65     loss	 $0.72</p>
<p> Net profit		25,470     loss	23,178</p>
<p> Service revs	     4,300			456</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.25     loss	 $1.22</p>
<p> Net loss		   9,848     loss	38,458</p>
<p> Service revs	     6,427		    1,032</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is United International Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>1996 periods include a gain of $65.3 million from the sale of investment in an affiliated company.</p>
